# Laid out Medium on a phone on its side (sfdesk frame.mbt's tape): MBUI_WIN=844x390 MBUI_FILM_PLATFORM=2, its size
# classes expanded in width and compact in height, a finger. The same steps as tape.drive.
system {"size_class":{"width":"expanded","height":"compact"}}
timeout 20000
until 发消息
wait 1000
tap 首页的列表改成按天分组
wait 1300
tapxy -90 200
wait 1300
back
wait 1300
tapxy -90 200
wait 1300
exit
